WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.010
Someone hands you a
graph of a car's journey.

2
00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:07.190
Speed up the side, time along
the bottom, and a single line.

3
00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:08.190
No map.

4
00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:09.770
No stopwatch readings.

5
00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:11.270
No tape measure.

6
00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:12.870
Yet from that one line,

7
00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:16.270
you can work out how hard
the car braked and how far it

8
00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:17.390
travelled.

9
00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:19.970
How can one line hold all that?

10
00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:23.450
In this mission, you'll
calculate speed and acceleration,

11
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.240
and learn to read a motion
graph like a detective.

12
00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:29.390
You'll find out what the
slope of the line tells you,

13
00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:32.410
and what the space
underneath it can reveal.

14
00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:36.660
Your mission: learn to read a
whole journey from one line.
